      ],
      "mentions": [
        "bookbinding",
        "typography"
      ],
      "excerpt": "Clipped because of the third section, on *gloss placement* — the argument that where an annotation sits is itself information, and that a comment thread throws that information away. The claim I want to test: a margin is a spatial index. A thread is a temporal one. They are not substitutes, and most",
      "sceneText": "",
      "url": "https://example.org/marginalia-as-interface",
